{"id":"n87341-1-9","stage":5,"title":"확립 · 确立","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87341-1-9-1","ko":"장병들의 군기가 대단하군요.","zh":"这些士兵的纪律真严明啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장병들의","meaning":"官兵","explanation":"장병：官兵；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"장병","audio":"/audio/27252a46ccc3b40fd5ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73732","senseId":"1","lemma":"장병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"군기가","meaning":"军纪","explanation":"군기：军纪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"군기","audio":"/audio/49f29100120003ddef4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35539","senseId":"1","lemma":"군기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대단하군요.","meaning":"很出色，很杰出","explanation":"대단하다：很出色，很杰出；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"대단하다","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46607","senseId":"3","lemma":"대단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"27252a46ccc3b40f","term":"장병","zh":"官兵","audio":"/audio/27252a46ccc3b40fd5ad.mp3","entryId":"73732","definition":"将校和士兵等的所有军人。","pronunciation":["장ː병"]},{"id":"49f29100120003dd","term":"군기","zh":"军纪","audio":"/audio/49f29100120003ddef4d.mp3","entryId":"35539","definition":"军队的纪律和规矩。","pronunciation":["군기"]},{"id":"a89a72f50dfdf2da","term":"대단하다","zh":"很出色，很杰出","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3","entryId":"46607","definition":"非常突出。","pronunciation":["대ː단하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d993c02a20d339939cd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87341-1-9-2","ko":"군인들의 기강 확립을 위해 규율을 엄격하게 적용하고 있습니다.","zh":"为了树立军人的纪律性，我们正在严格执行各项规定。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"군인들의","meaning":"军人","explanation":"군인：军人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"군인","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62241","senseId":"1","lemma":"군인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기강","meaning":"纪纲，纲纪","explanation":"기강：纪纲，纲纪","readings":[{"term":"기강","audio":"/audio/d1a67fc6426941e7bfbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40175","senseId":"1","lemma":"기강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확립을","meaning":"确立","explanation":"확립：确立；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"확립","audio":"/audio/48c3539b57864e367946.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87341","senseId":"1","lemma":"확립","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위해","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"1","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"규율을","meaning":"纪律，法则","explanation":"규율：纪律，法则；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"규율","audio":"/audio/69023144c9c8c471c72b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35258","senseId":"1","lemma":"규율","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄격하게","meaning":"严格","explanation":"엄격하다：严格；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"엄격하다","audio":"/audio/279ebc953bf07ed96dd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15114","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄격하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적용하고","meaning":"运用，应用","explanation":"적용하다：运用，应用；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"적용하다","audio":"/audio/3848048fa5b98c9ec62c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62336","senseId":"1","lemma":"적용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8be042648e2b4352","term":"군인","zh":"军人","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3","entryId":"62241","definition":"隶属于军队并接受使用武器等的军事训练，承担一定任务的人。","pronunciation":["구닌"]},{"id":"d1a67fc6426941e7","term":"기강","zh":"纪纲，纲纪","audio":"/audio/d1a67fc6426941e7bfbd.mp3","entryId":"40175","definition":"某一组织或社会的纪律与秩序。","pronunciation":["기강"]},{"id":"48c3539b57864e36","term":"확립","zh":"确立","audio":"/audio/48c3539b57864e367946.mp3","entryId":"87341","definition":"思想或体系等得到确实地树立；或指使其确实地树立。","pronunciation":["황닙"]},{"id":"96303fbb42bf3d76","term":"위하다","zh":"为了","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3","entryId":"29736","definition":"想要让什么有利或帮助什么。","pronunciation":["위하다"]},{"id":"69023144c9c8c471","term":"규율","zh":"纪律，法则","audio":"/audio/69023144c9c8c471c72b.mp3","entryId":"35258","definition":"为了维持社会或组织的秩序而规定的人们必须遵守的条例。","pronunciation":["규율"]},{"id":"279ebc953bf07ed9","term":"엄격하다","zh":"严格","audio":"/audio/279ebc953bf07ed96dd3.mp3","entryId":"15114","definition":"话语、态度或规则等十分严密而彻底。","pronunciation":["엄껴카다"]},{"id":"3848048fa5b98c9e","term":"적용하다","zh":"运用，应用","audio":"/audio/3848048fa5b98c9ec62c.mp3","entryId":"62336","definition":"根据需要恰当地使用或实施。","pronunciation":["저굥하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/31f2f571a429e5d6d944.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.853,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87341","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":6.6797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为了树立军人的纪律性，我们正在严格执行各项规定。","这些士兵的纪律真严明啊。","据说，针对在街上卖东西的摊贩的执法力度要加强了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这些士兵的纪律真严明啊。","据说，针对在街上卖东西的摊贩的执法力度要加强了。","为了树立军人的纪律性，我们正在严格执行各项规定。"],"answer":2}]}
